# An emblem's ability is the text of the ability that made it (CR 114.2, 612.4). Bot2 changes Kaito, Bane of Nightmares,
# Ninja to Elf, while he is a spell (the change goes on to the permanent, CR 400.7a). On his controller's turn he is an
# Elf creature, and the emblem his +1 makes says "Elves you control get +1/+1": he is a 4/5, where an emblem still
# about Ninjas would leave him 3/4.

